flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{ResNet model loaded?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Reuse in-memory model]
    B -- No --> D[Load PKL bundle\n• Deserialize Keras model\n• Restore scaler & metadata]
    D --> C
    C --> E[Fetch record signals from processed_data/signals]
    E --> F{Signal found?}
    F -- No --> X[Abort with missing signal error]
    F -- Yes --> G[Preprocess FHR\n• Clip 50-200 bpm\n• Resample to 5000\n• Median/MAD normalise]
    G --> H[Fetch clinical row from clinical_dataset.csv]
    H --> I{Clinical data available?}
    I -- No --> Y[Abort with missing clinical error]
    I -- Yes --> J[Convert features to numeric + impute]
    J --> K[Apply stored StandardScaler]
    K --> L[Assemble inputs\nsignal → (1,5000)\nclinical → (1,N)]
    L --> M[Model inference\nsoftmax probabilities]
    M --> N[Select predicted class + confidence]
    N --> O[Compose result payload]
    O --> P[Generate prediction diagnostics\n12 PNG visuals]
    P --> Q[Return prediction + artifacts]
    X --> Q
    Y --> Q
